WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.560
<i>The world is full of good things.</i>

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:04.850
Here I go!

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.890
<i>Things you want to capture in a photograph.</i>

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:05.780
Yeah!

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.420
Check out my watch!

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:09.870
Oh, nice one.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.240
<i>Things you want to show someone.</i>

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:15.060
<i>Fashion, books, movies.</i>

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:19.410
<i>Posters that move you.</i>

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.250
<b>New Tokyo 
School of Design</b>

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.250
<b>New Tokyo 
School of Design</b>

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.140
<i>That looks great.</i>

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:24.450
<i>I want to do something</i>

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:26.350
<i>like that too.</i>

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:31.130
Design that moves people

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:31.840
<i>Impact isn't everything, though.</i>

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.340
<i>You've got to develop a 
sense for these things.</i>

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>A sense... but how do you do that?</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:40.990
Souma!

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:42.280
Good morning!

00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:42.930
Good morning.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.420
Looking cute again as always.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:44.930
Thanks.

00:00:45.470 --> 00:00:47.920
So did you do that typography assignment?

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:48.440
Yeah.

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:49.320
Seriously?

00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.690
That's impressive.

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:52.360
I need to finish that up now...

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:54.770
Hey, I really like that look you've got going on today!

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:58.060
Deliberately mismatched socks.

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:34.210
<b>#04
 Shiki Souma</b>

00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:30.950
That's cute!

00:02:30.950 --> 00:02:33.000
That's great when you're tired 
of your coordinated look.

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:35.540
<i>Yeah, that was just a regular old mistake.</i>

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:37.220
<i>But you know, it's kinda...</i>

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:39.280
I just might copy you.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.170
Yeah. I think it would look good on you.

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:43.890
<i>I don't have to overthink it.</i>

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:46.800
<i>The world is full of good things.</i>

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:48.930
Hey, what are you laughing about?

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.340
I'm not really laughing.

00:02:50.550 --> 00:02:52.080
<i>Even right on my feet.</i>

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:54.050
You mean, you didn't do that on purpose?

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:55.910
<i>This is acceptable.</i>

00:02:56.110 --> 00:03:01.280
Shiki 
Souma

00:02:57.240 --> 00:03:01.280
Born January 21st

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.280
19 yrs / Vocational 
School Student

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:05.990
Cool and Awkward Files 04

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:04.930
<i>I think rather than the actual socks,</i>

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.990
Type who accepts it and stays positive

00:03:04.930 --> 00:03:07.480
<i>it's more important to be 
able to go with the flow</i>

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:10.730
<i>and accept things that aren't quite normal.</i>

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:14.430
Yo, that's not an automatic door.

00:03:15.760 --> 00:03:18.440
Sometimes you really crack yourself up, huh?

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:24.800
<i>Hmm, maybe it'll be crisper if 
I up the saturation a bit more.</i>

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:27.880
<i>But not too much, or it'll get too loud.</i>

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:29.320
Oh, there he is.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:30.560
Souma-kun!

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.550
Do you have some time right now?

00:03:32.550 --> 00:03:33.020
Sure.

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:36.870
I'm looking for someone to wear some of 
the clothes I made outside of class.

00:03:36.870 --> 00:03:38.730
Would you be willing to be my model?

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.590
Yes, if I fit the bill.

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:43.310
Oh, and could I also take pictures?

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:44.380
Sure.

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:45.740
Thank you!

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:49.190
I was really hoping to get a cute guy 
to wear them, so this makes me happy.

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:51.290
And you're always well-dressed too,

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:54.320
which is exactly the kind 
of person I wanted to ask.

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:57.780
Your outfit today is totally next-level too!

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:01.090
It's so cute!

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:02.600
Right?

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:05.690
Now, can you put this on?

00:04:05.690 --> 00:04:07.330
Over this is fine?

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:08.050
Yep!

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:10.130
I think they'll go nicely 
together, so that's good.

00:04:12.290 --> 00:04:13.890
Is it too big?

00:04:13.890 --> 00:04:14.770
No, it's good.

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:15.760
I like it like this.

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:18.590
Still, it's amazing that 
you can make clothes.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:20.020
I guess you are a fashion major.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:21.730
It's nothing fancy.

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:26.070
For now, I'm just randomly making 
things I like and seeing what sticks.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:27.980
This really is great though.

00:04:27.980 --> 00:04:29.960
Like, I want to own these clothes.

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:31.530
Really? Thank you!

00:04:31.530 --> 00:04:34.790
It's a real confidence boost 
to hear you say that.

00:04:35.430 --> 00:04:37.820
So you're planning on becoming a designer?

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:38.240
Yes!

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:42.550
My ultimate goal is to create my own brand.

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:45.240
You're in the Visual Design 
department, right?

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:46.080
Yeah.

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:48.680
Have you already decided what 
you want to do in the future?

00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:52.400
Figuring it out as you go, I guess?

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:56.740
<i>There's so many things I want to do,</i>

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:00.090
<i>but I don't have anything uniquely mine yet.</i>

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:03.100
I got it.

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:04.230
This is perfect.

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:04.990
Thank you!

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:07.320
No, thank you.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:10.330
Just let me know if you ever need me again.

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:12.240
Uhm... the clothes.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:14.120
<b>Giggle giggle</b>

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:14.870
I'm so sorry!

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:16.330
I almost stole them.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:19.220
It's so funny that you crack yourself up.

00:05:19.220 --> 00:05:20.460
<i>Your smile is precious.</i>

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:22.700
These are so comfortable I didn't realize.

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:24.620
Hm, really?

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:25.670
Yeah, really.

00:05:26.060 --> 00:05:29.140
Maybe I should work on mastering comfort.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:30.400
Just kidding.

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:32.700
Thanks for today!

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:34.590
This makes me want to get 
going on my next project.

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:36.890
I hope you'll come again when I'm ready.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:37.570
Sure.

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:41.930
<i>People who have their own 
strengths are so cool.</i>

00:05:43.720 --> 00:05:46.410
<i>Do I have anything like that?</i>

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.830
<i>I finished the assignment before work.</i>

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:57.960
<i>It's a bendy straw!</i>

00:05:58.570 --> 00:05:59.910
Thank you for waiting.

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:03.920
Today's dessert of the day:
Very Berry French Toast.

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:06.440
Thank you so much!

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:09.300
Could we get some small plates?

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:10.590
Certainly.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:12.290
I'll bring them now.

00:06:14.040 --> 00:06:16.340
Hey, don't you think that guy's cute?

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:17.340
Yeah, totally!

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:18.860
And he looks stylish.

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:20.740
Two small plates, please.

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:23.010
Here you go.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:25.910
Oh, sorry!

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:30.450
Also, could you please take 
this out to that table?

00:06:30.940 --> 00:06:31.690
Yes!

00:06:35.710 --> 00:06:36.860
Souma-kun?

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:38.320
Yes?

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:41.140
It's really great that 
you do such good work,

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:42.830
even though you only started here recently.

00:06:43.260 --> 00:06:44.920
Thank you.

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.790
My previous job was in food service as well.

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:52.870
You've been giggling this whole time.

00:06:52.870 --> 00:06:54.960
Did something funny happen?

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:59.260
No, I just keep remembering 
this dumb mistake I made.

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:03.230
Which was?

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:09.140
I was at another cafe before
I came here, and I ordered a drink.

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:12.100
And I didn't notice until I had finished it

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:14.300
that I had the straw in backwards the whole time.

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:17.650
I was like, man, pull yourself together.

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:20.990
And that's what you've been giggling about?

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.870
You're too funny.

00:07:23.590 --> 00:07:25.370
I'm so sorry.

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:26.380
We're at work.

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:29.040
Oh, I much prefer this 
over being too servile.

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:33.760
Being able to acknowledge something 
as silly or funny is good.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:38.530
I think one of your strengths is being able 
to interpret even small things as positive.

00:07:39.530 --> 00:07:41.230
<i>My strength...</i>

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:45.480
Remember when you made 
those "Help Wanted" flyers?

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.330
Yeah.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:50.490
Want to work with us at a stylish cafe?
 - 18 or older (high schoolers OK, students, freelancers welcome)
 - Hours TBD between 11:00 and 19:00 (2-3 hr a week OK)
 - 1000 Yen / hour

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:50.490
<b>Our staff meals are yummy!</b>

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:48.770
Instead of highlighting the 
normal aspects of the job,

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:51.630
you highlighted how delicious 
the free staff meals are.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:53.490
<b>Our staff meals are yummy!</b>

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.480
I found that so funny I laughed out loud.

00:07:53.480 --> 00:07:55.330
I'm really sorry!

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:56.450
Is only now

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:56.450
Is only now 
getting embarrassed...

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:56.630
It is so good, though.

00:07:57.090 --> 00:07:58.700
No need to apologize.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:04.680
Since you said that, now I know how much 
the other employees enjoy the food too.

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:07.060
I really love that.

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:15.650
You've also made me realize 
a lot of important things.

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:16.850
Really?

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:19.600
Well, I don't know what it could 
be, but I'm glad to hear that.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:23.580
Oh, could you put 
up the menu outside?

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:24.260
Yes!

00:08:24.990 --> 00:08:28.260
<i>Ideas and kindness start 
out from an affirmation.</i>

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:31.050
<i>By acknowledging and being acknowledged,</i>

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:33.400
<i>you build up your own 
individuality bit by bit.</i>

00:08:34.430 --> 00:08:36.810
<i>In this world that is full of good things,</i>

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:41.350
<i>I want to become able to 
move someone's heart.</i>

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:52.330
<i>He's looking at my flyer.</i>

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:54.260
Excuse me?

00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:00.480
You mean me?

00:09:01.580 --> 00:09:03.720
You're the only person here so...

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.440
<b>Blush</b>

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.440
<b>I was laughed at</b>

00:09:04.750 --> 00:09:06.190
If you're looking for a part-time job,

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.670
you should definitely consider this place.

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:10.400
Our staff meals are delicious.

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:12.540
<i>A part time job?</i>

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.100
<i>Wait, what?</i>

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:19.110
<i>This was a "Help Wanted" sign!</i>

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:22.090
<i>The staff meals look so good, 
I thought this was their menu!</i>

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:28.810
<i>This might be a good place for my new job...</i>

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:05.010
<b>Coming up next</b>

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:05.010
<b>Shared Table</b>

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:10.010
<b>We hope you'll tune in again!</b>

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:10.010
<b>We hope you'll tune in again!</b>
